Description: YUME stable C ABI runtime library
 YUME tunnels application streams through an authenticated TLS 1.3 carrier
 that can use an HTTP/2 camouflage preface.
 .
 This package contains libyume, the stable C ABI runtime for external
 integrations. It exposes build metadata plus opaque client, server, stream,
 and packet handles; the C++ implementation remains private.

